        "description": {
            "value": "<p>As postwar Ravounel grows, you help to determine its future through government work. You understand how to talk to the nation's citizenry and, more importantly, how to listen to their needs at a time when the world seems so uncertain.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Wisdom</strong> or <strong>Charisma</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Ravounel Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Impression] skill feat.</p>"
